WEBVTT

01:38.180 --> 01:41.039
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.090 --> 01:43.979
[Episode 13]

01:44.200 --> 01:45.350
I've checked the inn's ledger.

01:46.120 --> 01:47.430
It shows that nine days ago,

01:47.759 --> 01:48.950
Gao Sheng had stayed at this inn

01:49.400 --> 01:50.479
for four consecutive days.

01:50.950 --> 01:52.229
But the innkeeper and his staff

01:52.229 --> 01:52.950
had all told me

01:53.120 --> 01:54.000
they've never seen this person.

01:55.840 --> 01:57.280
This inn is indeed strange.

01:58.920 --> 02:00.000
The Cat Demon

02:00.000 --> 02:00.680
that led us here before

02:00.790 --> 02:02.070
appeared again last night.

02:02.950 --> 02:04.310
It led us to the Xin Court.

02:05.280 --> 02:06.350
At that place, we found

02:07.070 --> 02:08.590
Banxia's cousin.

02:11.680 --> 02:12.630
Banxia's cousin?

02:13.800 --> 02:14.240
Yes.

02:15.520 --> 02:16.910
He seems to know something,

02:17.520 --> 02:18.470
but he won't say it.

02:19.079 --> 02:20.079
So, is the culprit

02:20.750 --> 02:22.079
a demon or a human after all?

02:22.700 --> 02:23.540
Feng Tian said

02:23.870 --> 02:25.400
he was once a border guard,

02:25.960 --> 02:27.590
guarding the border alone for twenty years.

02:28.750 --> 02:29.960
Would such a person kill?

02:31.630 --> 02:32.520
That's not necessarily true.

02:32.800 --> 02:33.630
Maybe he's lying to you.

02:37.840 --> 02:38.800
What about that Cat Demon then?

02:41.079 --> 02:42.120
I'm not sure about

02:42.120 --> 02:42.870
its intentions yet.

02:43.520 --> 02:44.470
But I have a feeling

02:44.930 --> 02:46.420
that besides this Cat Demon and Feng Tian,

02:47.120 --> 02:47.910
there's something else

02:48.240 --> 02:49.870
hidden in this inn.

02:51.030 --> 02:51.470
It's just that we

02:51.470 --> 02:52.520
haven't discovered it yet.

02:53.520 --> 02:54.310
Yes, yes, yes.

02:54.960 --> 02:55.680
I feel like

02:55.680 --> 02:56.910
there's been something

02:56.910 --> 02:57.840
watching me lately.

03:01.360 --> 03:01.870
Physician Jiu,

03:02.360 --> 03:03.430
Youhuang said you have the ability

03:03.450 --> 03:04.520
to catch demons and monsters.

03:05.100 --> 03:05.850
Do you have any

03:06.190 --> 03:07.560
demon-suppressing or evil-repelling items

03:07.750 --> 03:08.960
to give me some courage?

03:09.870 --> 03:10.560
No.

03:12.000 --> 03:12.800
Come on, find me some.

03:14.960 --> 03:15.430
Let's go.

03:16.150 --> 03:16.710
Where to?

03:17.710 --> 03:18.710
Didn't you say Banxia's cousin

03:18.710 --> 03:19.680
seems to know something?

03:20.280 --> 03:20.910
Let's go ask him.

03:23.430 --> 03:23.840
Chief.

03:29.470 --> 03:29.910
Honored guest.

03:33.800 --> 03:34.240
Honored guest,

03:34.630 --> 03:35.590
someone is looking for you in the front courtyard.

03:36.310 --> 03:36.960
Who is it?

03:37.630 --> 03:39.280
Looks like a villager from down the mountain.

03:39.520 --> 03:40.240
He seems quite urgent.

03:40.630 --> 03:41.340
You'd better go check quickly.

03:41.630 --> 03:42.590
Villager?

03:51.520 --> 03:52.240
You're looking for me?

03:52.710 --> 03:53.770
Are you Chu Youhuang,

03:53.800 --> 03:54.590
Chief Constable Chu?

03:54.680 --> 03:55.590
I am. What's the matter?

03:55.960 --> 03:56.890
I went up the mountain early this morning

03:57.030 --> 03:58.590
and found a body near the cliff.

03:58.960 --> 04:00.470
There was this letter on the body.

04:01.150 --> 04:02.310
The letter mentions

04:02.520 --> 04:03.960
the Reunion Inn and you, Chief Constable Chu.

04:04.230 --> 04:05.910
So I thought I'd come and ask.

04:09.190 --> 04:10.630
This is the letter I wrote to Lord Geng.

04:10.960 --> 04:11.400
Chief,

04:11.630 --> 04:12.520
something happened to Yan Li.

04:13.630 --> 04:14.500
Where's the body?

04:14.750 --> 04:15.590
It's right by the cliff.

04:16.269 --> 04:17.000
Take us there.

04:17.079 --> 04:17.600
Alright.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.120
Where is it?

04:30.630 --> 04:31.270
It's right there.

04:33.510 --> 04:34.190
Yan Li.

04:38.480 --> 04:38.950
Yan Li.

04:39.510 --> 04:40.159
Yan Li.

04:42.480 --> 04:42.800
Chief.

04:43.750 --> 04:44.270
This.

04:45.800 --> 04:46.310
Yan Li.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.360
What happened?

04:54.159 --> 04:55.480
His neck was snapped.

04:56.510 --> 04:57.390
Who did this?

04:58.000 --> 04:59.270
Daring to attack an official.

05:00.190 --> 05:01.270
It's truly audacious.

05:02.120 --> 05:02.870
They'd better not let me catch them.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.270
They'd better not let me catch them.

05:04.830 --> 05:05.310
Chief.

05:06.270 --> 05:07.510
His son just turned one month old.

05:08.160 --> 05:09.430
They haven't even had the full moon celebration yet.

05:09.430 --> 05:10.000
Enough.

05:28.510 --> 05:29.390
Ji Nu'er.

05:30.600 --> 05:33.720
The swallow you gave me is really beautiful.

05:41.680 --> 05:42.240
Wuniang.

05:42.720 --> 05:43.270
Wuniang.

05:48.310 --> 05:48.830
Get out.

05:51.950 --> 05:52.600
Wuniang.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.240
I need to ask you something.

05:54.680 --> 05:55.870
You must answer truthfully.

05:57.480 --> 05:58.159
Did you

05:58.870 --> 06:00.310
kill that guy?

06:01.390 --> 06:01.950
No.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.650
I haven't even said who it was yet

06:03.680 --> 06:04.720
and you're already saying no?

06:05.120 --> 06:06.240
No matter who it is,

06:06.390 --> 06:07.430
I didn't kill them.

06:07.870 --> 06:09.160
Father, don't you believe me?

06:09.560 --> 06:10.430
Talking back to me?

06:12.190 --> 06:13.750
If you don't believe me, Father,

06:14.040 --> 06:15.720
you might as well turn me in.

06:15.870 --> 06:18.000
Aren't there constables at the shop?

06:18.870 --> 06:19.950
You can hand me over to them.

06:19.950 --> 06:20.720
That would solve it, wouldn't it?

06:21.750 --> 06:23.360
That's not what I meant.

06:25.430 --> 06:26.190
Tell me.

06:27.600 --> 06:28.950
Did you do it?

06:33.480 --> 06:34.750
Why do you look like

06:34.750 --> 06:36.240
you wish I had killed him, Father?

06:37.120 --> 06:37.800
Fine.

06:38.159 --> 06:39.240
I'll kill someone

06:39.800 --> 06:41.070
to fulfill your wish then!

06:41.159 --> 06:42.480
Don't be ridiculous.

06:42.870 --> 06:43.510
Father.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.240
Do you know me at all?

06:46.800 --> 06:47.360
Wuniang.

06:50.950 --> 06:52.159
I just want you to

06:52.270 --> 06:53.870
live a peaceful life.

06:56.159 --> 06:57.630
I won't bring shame to you, that's all.

06:59.680 --> 07:00.310
Wuniang.

07:01.270 --> 07:02.750
Can't you be a bit more obedient?

07:04.040 --> 07:06.120
I just want what's best for you.

07:08.270 --> 07:09.000
Alright.

07:10.000 --> 07:11.750
Yanqiu, it's me, Banxia.

07:32.070 --> 07:32.800
I‘ll head out now.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.159
Yanqiu.

07:39.510 --> 07:41.310
I thought you weren't in your room.

07:41.830 --> 07:42.600
Why didn't you answer

07:42.630 --> 07:43.800
when I knocked earlier?

07:44.360 --> 07:46.750
Arm in arm while we come and go.

07:47.390 --> 07:50.630
Lingering close by your knee below.

07:54.950 --> 07:55.830
Well sung.

08:03.680 --> 08:04.430
Yanqiu.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.510
What are you doing?

08:06.270 --> 08:07.040
Banxia, you're here.

08:07.720 --> 08:08.190
Have a seat.

08:08.870 --> 08:09.800
Let's listen to music together.

08:18.510 --> 08:19.750
Cousin, what are you staring at?

08:20.830 --> 08:22.160
Your sister-in-law.

08:32.600 --> 08:33.320
Yanqiu.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.390
What on earth are you talking about?

08:36.720 --> 08:37.549
She can't handle it.

08:37.900 --> 08:38.780
She can't bear to hear this.

08:45.600 --> 08:47.360
Your sister-in-law laughs that you're just a little girl,

08:48.080 --> 08:49.120
not used to hearing these tunes

08:49.250 --> 08:50.700
about frontier travel

08:50.790 --> 08:52.080
that are full of panic and chaos.

08:52.630 --> 08:53.840
She wants to sing you

08:54.030 --> 08:56.790
a lighter, more melodious love poem.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.750
Han Guang: Tall Trees in the South.

08:58.750 --> 08:59.510
Have you heard it before?

09:03.960 --> 09:08.960
♫There are tall trees in the south♫

09:10.510 --> 09:15.000
♫But they offer no rest♫

09:16.720 --> 09:20.200
♫There are beautiful wandering girls by the Han River♫

09:20.870 --> 09:27.510
♫But they cannot be pursued♫

09:28.960 --> 09:34.720
♫The Han River is so wide, it cannot be swum across♫

09:34.720 --> 09:37.440
♫The Yangtze flows so long♫

09:37.670 --> 09:42.630
♫It cannot be crossed from any direction♫

09:49.750 --> 09:50.320
Banxia.

09:52.010 --> 09:52.590
Be careful.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.630
How is it?

09:55.840 --> 09:58.440
I'll go get you water to wipe your face.

09:59.190 --> 10:00.070
Come, come.

10:01.080 --> 10:02.840
Keep me company to drink wine

10:04.150 --> 10:04.840
and listening to music.

10:14.700 --> 10:15.780
How did you discover him?

10:17.510 --> 10:18.240
Reporting to Chief Constable Chu,

10:18.840 --> 10:20.100
this place, usually,

10:20.150 --> 10:21.840
has very few people and a lot of firewood.

10:21.960 --> 10:22.480
I...

10:22.870 --> 10:24.390
I came here to chop wood.

10:25.830 --> 10:26.950
Don't leave the village recently.

10:27.390 --> 10:27.870
You can go back now.

10:28.080 --> 10:28.740
Yes.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.120
Yan Li's martial skills are quite good.

10:40.390 --> 10:41.960
Even if he couldn't defeat a strong enemy,

10:42.790 --> 10:44.270
he should have been able to escape.

10:46.320 --> 10:47.750
This criminal's grip strength is incredible.

10:48.290 --> 10:48.960
The flesh on his back

10:48.960 --> 10:49.960
was completely torn off.

10:51.620 --> 10:52.410
What kind of person

10:52.440 --> 10:53.750
would do such a thing?

10:56.670 --> 10:57.720
In such remote mountains,

10:58.550 --> 10:59.440
who could know?

10:59.870 --> 11:00.390
Unless...

11:02.600 --> 11:03.510
Yan Li could speak.

11:18.510 --> 11:19.390
You can't go in.

11:20.750 --> 11:22.600
This is my family's inn.

11:23.120 --> 11:24.270
Why can't I enter?

11:27.350 --> 11:28.240
You still can't go in.

11:30.200 --> 11:31.510
Fine, I won't go in then.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.440
What's the big deal?

11:44.080 --> 11:45.000
How could you do this?

11:45.030 --> 11:46.720
I... I've already come in.

11:46.790 --> 11:47.870
What more do you want?

11:48.320 --> 11:49.510
Banxia, she tricked me.

11:51.200 --> 11:52.390
Oh, Miss Duan is here too.

11:55.840 --> 11:57.080
Why are you here?

11:58.790 --> 12:00.510
I came to bring wine for Mr. Duan.

12:00.920 --> 12:02.800
Didn't I tell you?

12:03.080 --> 12:04.270
Ever since he arrived,

12:04.480 --> 12:05.840
he's been staying in his room all day,

12:06.440 --> 12:08.510
just drinking wine.

12:08.920 --> 12:10.410
Didn't you tell me before

12:10.440 --> 12:11.670
that you hardly ever saw him

12:12.000 --> 12:13.030
and that you almost forgot about him?

12:15.080 --> 12:17.770
Before, it was the servants taking care of him.

12:19.080 --> 12:20.060
But I heard

12:20.440 --> 12:22.150
that he's your cousin.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.840
So, I came personally.

12:24.600 --> 12:25.240
Wait a moment.

12:35.550 --> 12:36.600
What exactly is this?

12:38.080 --> 12:40.440
This is Fubai Wine.

12:41.240 --> 12:42.870
Haven't you heard of it, Miss Duan?

12:44.480 --> 12:45.960
The guests who come here

12:46.440 --> 12:48.440
all really like this wine.

12:48.870 --> 12:51.240
They say that after drinking it,

12:51.570 --> 12:52.540
they could see

12:52.570 --> 12:54.260
the person they miss the most.

12:55.750 --> 12:56.320
Miss Duan,

12:57.670 --> 12:58.720
would you like some?

13:25.670 --> 13:26.550
There was only one assailant.

13:27.440 --> 13:28.550
His foot measures eight inches and two tenths.

13:28.630 --> 13:30.150
About seven feet tall. Male.

13:30.390 --> 13:31.240
He was young.

13:32.560 --> 13:33.290
But he was heavy.

13:34.310 --> 13:35.000
Must be a fat guy.

13:36.790 --> 13:37.600
Not necessarily.

13:54.790 --> 13:56.000
Although he wasn't agile,

13:56.200 --> 13:57.200
he was physically strong.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.470
If he were fat,

13:59.670 --> 14:01.000
he couldn't have been so quick.

14:02.000 --> 14:03.510
He should be of medium build,

14:03.960 --> 14:05.080
a physically strong man.

14:10.320 --> 14:11.240
He didn't carry any weapons.

14:12.840 --> 14:13.960
Yan Li was skilled in martial arts.

14:14.670 --> 14:15.670
If he could be killed barehanded,

14:16.270 --> 14:17.080
could the assailant be

14:17.360 --> 14:18.240
someone with exceptional martial arts skills?

14:27.390 --> 14:27.840
No.

14:29.030 --> 14:29.840
He was stabbed.

14:38.030 --> 14:38.600
But why isn't there

14:38.600 --> 14:39.750
any trace of blood on the ground?

14:41.770 --> 14:42.840
Perhaps it was cleaned up.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.390
Or perhaps he was wearing an armour.

14:45.110 --> 14:46.420
That's why his body was so heavy.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.440
He tore off Yan Li's skin with his bare hands.

15:28.480 --> 15:29.720
This method is too cruel.

15:51.870 --> 15:52.840
He seemed completely unafraid of

15:52.870 --> 15:53.870
Yan Li's resistance.

15:55.510 --> 15:56.320
It was as if he was toying with

15:56.320 --> 15:57.240
a plaything.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.270
This strangulation mark...

16:14.550 --> 16:16.000
He's missing a finger on his right hand.

16:16.960 --> 16:17.960
I'm just a bit dizzy.

16:18.150 --> 16:19.320
I'll be fine after a short rest.

16:19.670 --> 16:21.050
Please don't worry about it.

16:22.940 --> 16:24.190
That person is in the inn.

16:24.730 --> 16:25.340
I've seen him.

16:40.840 --> 16:41.480
What's this?

16:50.470 --> 16:50.990
From now on,

16:51.010 --> 16:52.130
don't bring this kind of wine anymore.

16:54.290 --> 16:55.440
If customers want to drink,

16:55.870 --> 16:57.870
we have no reason not to sell it.

16:59.130 --> 16:59.760
Yanqiu is now

16:59.790 --> 17:02.030
in a daze and unclear every day.

17:02.200 --> 17:02.840
I am his sister.

17:02.870 --> 17:04.270
I have the right to make decisions for him.

17:05.380 --> 17:06.660
If you bring this wine again,

17:06.880 --> 17:07.960
don't blame me for getting angry with you.

17:09.030 --> 17:11.200
Alright, if you don't want it, I won't bring it.

17:11.550 --> 17:13.550
Please don't be angry, Miss Duan.

17:15.030 --> 17:16.310
Take them away quickly.

17:18.030 --> 17:18.680
Miss Duan.

17:22.940 --> 17:23.589
Miss Duan.

17:36.920 --> 17:37.550
Liar.

17:40.480 --> 17:42.070
I was just teasing you.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.240
You really got angry?

17:45.790 --> 17:46.920
What happened to your neck?

17:48.960 --> 17:49.720
I have something to do.

17:51.030 --> 17:52.030
I'm not playing with you anymore.

18:01.030 --> 18:01.550
Let's go.

18:14.480 --> 18:15.480
Sir, sir.

18:16.750 --> 18:17.440
Put it down first.

18:18.150 --> 18:19.270
Everything has been taken care of.

18:20.110 --> 18:20.720
It seems the innkeeper

18:20.750 --> 18:22.000
is very concerned about my colleague.

18:22.160 --> 18:22.750
Yes, indeed.

18:22.960 --> 18:23.440
Put it down first.

18:24.170 --> 18:24.990
After all,

18:25.020 --> 18:26.260
it's a human life.

18:27.310 --> 18:27.750
Is that so?

18:28.640 --> 18:29.790
If he were alive,

18:30.200 --> 18:31.480
he would probably thank you in person.

18:33.000 --> 18:33.510
Don't move.

18:35.200 --> 18:35.680
Sir.

18:35.830 --> 18:37.780
This person died outside.

18:37.960 --> 18:40.110
Let's not bring him inside.

18:40.270 --> 18:41.680
There are guests inside after all.

18:42.250 --> 18:43.530
I am the Chief Constable of Guangping City.

18:43.960 --> 18:45.030
I suspect your inn

18:45.270 --> 18:45.830
is connected to the murder

18:45.850 --> 18:46.850
of my colleague.

18:47.160 --> 18:47.960
From this moment on,

18:48.270 --> 18:49.160
the inn is closed.

18:49.400 --> 18:50.440
No one is allowed to enter or leave.

18:50.720 --> 18:51.270
Do you understand?

18:51.480 --> 18:52.680
You can't say that, sir.

18:52.800 --> 18:53.930
The person died outside,

18:53.960 --> 18:55.440
not inside my inn.

18:55.460 --> 18:56.980
What does it have to do with us?

18:57.200 --> 18:57.920
Moreover,

18:58.440 --> 18:59.720
do you have any evidence?

19:02.680 --> 19:04.200
With evidence, it's called solving a case.

19:04.830 --> 19:06.440
Without evidence, it's called investigating a case.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.350
Any objections?

19:24.330 --> 19:24.890
Xuanye,

19:25.440 --> 19:26.270
keep a close eye on things for me.

19:36.960 --> 19:38.440
What's going on here?

19:40.110 --> 19:41.590
I asked you to watch the inn earlier.

19:42.020 --> 19:42.850
Have you seen a man

19:42.880 --> 19:43.440
with only

19:43.440 --> 19:44.550
four fingers on his right hand?

19:45.240 --> 19:45.680
Yes, I have.

19:45.960 --> 19:46.790
I just saw him.

19:46.830 --> 19:47.680
He left with Wuniang.

19:48.870 --> 19:49.550
Where did they go?

19:50.110 --> 19:50.680
Follow me.

20:11.490 --> 20:12.070
Alright.

20:18.000 --> 20:18.790
Thank you, Wuniang.

20:19.720 --> 20:20.200
Sir.

20:20.830 --> 20:21.350
Sir.

20:21.480 --> 20:22.000
It's here.

20:22.140 --> 20:22.930
Dear guests.

20:22.960 --> 20:24.030
Where are you going?

20:24.400 --> 20:25.240
To look for your servant.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.900
If there's anything, just tell me.

20:26.960 --> 20:27.270
Sir.

20:29.480 --> 20:29.960
Sir.

20:30.240 --> 20:30.830
Sir.

20:31.160 --> 20:31.750
It's him.

20:33.880 --> 20:34.270
This...

20:35.110 --> 20:35.960
Mr. Jiu.

20:37.000 --> 20:38.070
I clearly saw it.

20:38.720 --> 20:39.790
Saw what?

20:40.400 --> 20:41.790
He only has four fingers on his right hand.

20:42.880 --> 20:43.640
Wh-what?

20:44.110 --> 20:45.270
You must have seen wrong.

20:45.790 --> 20:46.450
Impossible.

20:47.550 --> 20:48.750
That's strange then.

20:49.440 --> 20:51.680
He clearly has five fingers here.

20:51.750 --> 20:52.510
That's right.

20:55.240 --> 20:55.720
Sir.

20:57.110 --> 20:57.960
What are you trying to do?

20:58.200 --> 20:59.240
You're scaring her.

20:59.960 --> 21:01.440
If you have any questions, talk to me.

21:07.680 --> 21:09.110
Innkeeper, if you have nothing to hide,

21:09.830 --> 21:11.000
why are you stopping me?

21:12.170 --> 21:14.780
Do you know that harbouring is the same as being an accomplice?

21:15.160 --> 21:16.070
Mr. Jiu,

21:16.680 --> 21:17.960
you and your group

21:17.960 --> 21:18.920
sought to lodge late at night.

21:19.200 --> 21:20.340
I was the one who persuaded Father

21:20.440 --> 21:21.550
to let you stay.

21:21.830 --> 21:23.640
Now you're being so rude to us.

21:23.960 --> 21:25.640
Don't you think your behaviour is inappropriate?

21:25.720 --> 21:26.550
Don't be disrespectful.

21:29.110 --> 21:29.640
Sir,

21:30.070 --> 21:30.880
as you know,

21:31.200 --> 21:33.160
my daughter has been sickly since childhood.

21:34.030 --> 21:34.790
If we have offended you in any way,

21:35.790 --> 21:37.160
please be understanding.

21:40.460 --> 21:42.130
A fox will definitely

21:42.160 --> 21:43.440
show its tail one day.

21:44.680 --> 21:45.270
Innkeeper,

21:46.240 --> 21:47.150
I advise you to

21:47.180 --> 21:48.710
keep a close eye on your people.

21:49.640 --> 21:50.730
Don't wait until one day

21:51.270 --> 21:52.350
something slips up.

21:55.550 --> 21:56.160
Alright.

21:57.830 --> 21:58.640
Please, honoured guest.

21:59.240 --> 21:59.850
Please leave.

22:17.830 --> 22:19.030
Father, what's this?

22:20.090 --> 22:20.810
What's wrong?

22:26.370 --> 22:27.680
Did you do this?

22:29.030 --> 22:29.440
No.

22:30.240 --> 22:30.800
Not you?

22:33.220 --> 22:35.170
Then what happened to his fingers?

22:37.750 --> 22:38.310
Yes.

22:38.950 --> 22:40.670
Quickly tell my father

22:41.310 --> 22:42.720
what happened to your fingers?

22:49.030 --> 22:49.750
Leave.

22:54.160 --> 22:54.960
Get out!

23:06.540 --> 23:07.450
Why is it that every time

23:07.470 --> 23:08.790
something like this happens,

23:09.860 --> 23:10.620
Father always

23:10.650 --> 23:12.330
suspects me first?

23:15.480 --> 23:16.200
I understand now.

23:17.550 --> 23:18.790
Because in Father's heart,

23:19.510 --> 23:21.080
I am such an evil person.

23:21.720 --> 23:23.240
I would do evil things.

23:24.640 --> 23:26.240
That's why you won't take me home,

23:26.880 --> 23:28.270
won't let me see Grandfather and Grandmother,

23:28.970 --> 23:30.040
and insist on keeping me in such a

23:30.070 --> 23:31.410
godforsaken place

23:31.440 --> 23:32.510
running an inn.

23:38.170 --> 23:39.080
You're afraid I might harm

23:39.110 --> 23:40.160
your family,

23:40.680 --> 23:41.240
aren't you?

23:42.160 --> 23:43.310
That's not true.

23:45.070 --> 23:46.160
Then please, my dear Father,

23:46.160 --> 23:47.110
tell me.

23:47.640 --> 23:48.440
If it's not like that,

23:49.200 --> 23:50.110
then what is it?

23:51.270 --> 23:52.960
You are my family.

23:53.110 --> 23:54.790
Then who would be afraid of their own family?

23:54.890 --> 23:56.210
I'm not afraid of you.

23:56.240 --> 23:56.790
You are.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.270
You've always been afraid of me

23:59.780 --> 24:00.910
and you're getting more and more afraid.

24:07.400 --> 24:08.160
Father,

24:09.240 --> 24:11.550
since you don't like me anyway,

24:12.310 --> 24:13.490
why don't you let me go?

24:14.000 --> 24:15.110
Just like my brother.

24:15.960 --> 24:16.480
Once I leave,

24:16.480 --> 24:17.200
I will never

24:17.200 --> 24:18.310
cause you trouble again.

24:18.310 --> 24:18.830
No.

24:19.120 --> 24:20.210
You can't go anywhere.

24:20.550 --> 24:21.880
It's not safe out there.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.200
This is your home.

24:26.480 --> 24:27.070
Home?

24:33.000 --> 24:33.680
Fine.

24:35.510 --> 24:36.590
Then we'll just stay here.

24:38.030 --> 24:38.830
But if

24:39.660 --> 24:40.750
someone else gets hurt,

24:42.930 --> 24:43.460
Father, don't you dare

24:43.480 --> 24:44.720
blame it on me.

25:25.640 --> 25:26.640
Yanqiu, you're awake.

25:28.030 --> 25:28.640
Banxia.

25:29.180 --> 25:29.800
You're here.

25:32.430 --> 25:33.110
Are you alright?

25:36.110 --> 25:36.880
I'm fine.

25:39.880 --> 25:41.030
Was it because of that wine?

25:45.190 --> 25:46.760
The innkeeper's daughter just came by.

25:47.240 --> 25:48.960
She said the wine is called Fubai Wine.

25:49.510 --> 25:50.570
After drinking it,

25:50.640 --> 25:51.960
you could see the person you miss the most.

25:55.160 --> 25:56.000
So you know everything.

26:01.640 --> 26:02.270
That's right.

26:03.310 --> 26:04.930
The world is truly vast,

26:04.960 --> 26:06.400
full of wonders.

26:07.480 --> 26:08.590
Over the past six months,

26:10.630 --> 26:12.350
I've really broadened my horizons.

26:13.440 --> 26:15.030
Not only have I seen demons,

26:19.400 --> 26:20.400
but I've also tasted

26:21.880 --> 26:23.350
this Fubai Wine.

26:31.110 --> 26:32.680
Do you know how clear it was?

26:33.830 --> 26:35.640
It wasn't like a normal drunken dream.

26:37.110 --> 26:38.880
It's just like it's real.

26:43.240 --> 26:44.880
She's right in front of me,

26:46.680 --> 26:47.720
talking to me,

26:50.180 --> 26:50.960
laughing and chatting,

26:51.960 --> 26:53.480
so vivid and lifelike.

26:54.000 --> 26:54.960
It's as if...

26:57.560 --> 26:58.650
It's as if she never

26:58.680 --> 27:00.450
left at all.

27:09.440 --> 27:10.030
Banxia,

27:10.830 --> 27:12.140
do you want to try it?

27:13.030 --> 27:14.160
I'll ask for a bit more.

27:14.550 --> 27:15.260
Just a little,

27:15.510 --> 27:16.880
and you can see your parents.

27:17.270 --> 27:17.960
Give it a try.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.030
Yanqiu,

27:20.180 --> 27:21.470
you can't stay here any longer.

27:24.670 --> 27:25.830
Grandmother, Uncle and Aunt

27:25.860 --> 27:27.070
are still at home.

27:27.450 --> 27:28.340
You haven't gone back for so long,

27:28.370 --> 27:29.610
they're very worried about you.

27:33.960 --> 27:34.640
Home?

27:38.880 --> 27:40.830
How can home be as good as here?

27:42.310 --> 27:43.750
Here, I have Manniang with me.

27:44.790 --> 27:45.680
You've already been here

27:45.700 --> 27:46.840
for half a month.

27:47.120 --> 27:48.690
It's all because of this Fubai Wine.

27:48.790 --> 27:49.720
Come to your senses.

28:03.610 --> 28:04.370
Manniang.

28:25.960 --> 28:26.590
Chi Xue.

28:29.790 --> 28:30.510
Chi Xue.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.640
Why is it here again?

29:27.960 --> 29:29.400
Didn't we come from here?

29:57.680 --> 29:58.510
Is anyone there?

30:01.050 --> 30:02.010
Is anyone there?

30:13.960 --> 30:14.830
Nine Lives.

30:34.000 --> 30:34.510
Banxia.

30:34.510 --> 30:35.160
Xuanye.

30:35.440 --> 30:36.160
What are you looking for?

30:36.400 --> 30:37.960
I thought I just saw Nine Lives.

30:40.690 --> 30:41.660
Let's go back first.

30:50.240 --> 30:51.070
The culprit should be

30:51.070 --> 30:52.440
that servant you mentioned.

30:53.790 --> 30:54.680
Then let's catch him!

30:55.920 --> 30:56.760
Who cares if it's him or not?

30:56.900 --> 30:57.750
Let's bring him in first,

30:57.880 --> 30:58.960
and we'll find out after interrogation.

30:59.610 --> 31:00.410
No matter how tough he is,

31:00.590 --> 31:01.880
he can't be tougher than the torture instruments in prison.

31:02.160 --> 31:02.720
Shopkeeper Feng Tian

31:02.720 --> 31:03.790
won't allow us to make a move.

31:05.030 --> 31:06.060
According to Physician Jiu,

31:06.090 --> 31:06.890
his martial arts skills are impressive.

31:07.790 --> 31:08.750
And that servant,

31:09.110 --> 31:10.070
he's not an ordinary person either.

31:11.200 --> 31:13.310
There's more than one servant in this inn.

31:14.110 --> 31:15.320
There's also that Wuniang.

31:15.830 --> 31:17.400
I always felt she was strange.

31:18.790 --> 31:19.440
Don't forget,

31:19.960 --> 31:22.000
there's also a Cat Demon lurking in the shadows.

31:23.070 --> 31:23.440
So,

31:24.550 --> 31:25.610
if we can't beat them,

31:25.640 --> 31:26.270
let's retreat

31:26.640 --> 31:27.350
and go back to get more help.

31:29.000 --> 31:29.640
Do you think they'll

31:29.640 --> 31:30.550
obediently wait for us

31:30.550 --> 31:31.400
to come back and catch them?

31:31.790 --> 31:33.070
My cousin is still here.

31:34.350 --> 31:35.830
He's addicted to Fubai Wine.

31:35.960 --> 31:36.690
For the time being,

31:36.710 --> 31:38.190
he definitely won't be willing to leave.

31:39.640 --> 31:40.240
Fubai Wine?

31:45.400 --> 31:46.240
I was in such a hurry earlier

31:46.270 --> 31:47.310
that I forgot to tell you.

31:48.200 --> 31:49.400
I found out that this inn

31:49.490 --> 31:50.530
is selling a kind of wine,

31:50.800 --> 31:51.840
called the Fubai Wine.

31:52.180 --> 31:53.370
It's said that after drinking it,

31:53.480 --> 31:54.960
you could see the person you miss the most.

31:55.440 --> 31:56.310
My brother is like this now

31:56.310 --> 31:57.270
because he drank this wine

31:57.750 --> 31:59.240
and became immersed in heartache of

31:59.270 --> 32:00.110
missing my sister-in-law.

32:00.350 --> 32:01.830
That's why he refuses to leave.

32:09.310 --> 32:10.680
We dare not act rashly.

32:11.510 --> 32:12.790
I believe they won't either.

32:13.310 --> 32:14.030
I'll go back first to settle

32:14.030 --> 32:14.960
Yan Li's body.

32:15.920 --> 32:17.790
We'll discuss the rest later.

32:26.880 --> 32:27.640
Xuanye,

32:28.550 --> 32:29.590
I don't think the Cat Demon

32:29.590 --> 32:30.640
is with them.

32:32.830 --> 32:34.310
I got lost in the courtyard earlier,

32:34.640 --> 32:35.610
and it seems the Cat Demon

32:35.630 --> 32:36.630
guided me back.

32:42.880 --> 32:44.000
Are you sure your cousin

32:44.270 --> 32:45.480
was drinking Fubai Wine?

32:47.310 --> 32:48.160
I'm certain.

32:49.480 --> 32:50.830
You've heard of this wine too?

32:56.440 --> 32:56.960
Yanzi,

33:00.370 --> 33:01.570
I've failed you.

33:03.810 --> 33:05.120
You've only been married for a year,

33:06.560 --> 33:07.750
and just had a son.

33:08.430 --> 33:09.360
How can I face

33:09.380 --> 33:10.030
your family?

33:10.590 --> 33:11.640
You're an only child.

33:14.550 --> 33:15.200
It's all my fault.

33:16.960 --> 33:17.880
I should have gone instead.

33:21.790 --> 33:22.550
Let's solve this case quickly

33:24.590 --> 33:25.680
and avenge Yan Li.

33:27.270 --> 33:27.720
Right.

33:29.030 --> 33:29.640
Revenge.

34:19.880 --> 34:21.070
I've finally found you.

34:29.110 --> 34:29.630
Catch.

34:32.429 --> 34:33.280
No fun at all.

34:33.880 --> 34:34.310
Take it away.

34:36.280 --> 34:37.760
You're only giving it to me because you don't want it anymore?

34:41.179 --> 34:42.070
I need to go out for a while.

34:42.260 --> 34:43.139
Protect Banxia well.

34:43.550 --> 34:44.670
Don't leave her side, understand?

34:47.150 --> 34:47.960
Where are you going?

34:49.360 --> 34:50.070
None of your business.

34:55.620 --> 34:57.330
[Xin]

35:05.960 --> 35:07.280
Banxia is very worried about you.

35:09.070 --> 35:10.840
This wine is called Fubai Wine.

35:11.400 --> 35:14.040
It uses abalone shell and cornelian cherry as its guiding ingredients,

35:14.660 --> 35:16.070
supplemented with wheat bran,

35:16.320 --> 35:17.320
and brewed through fermentation.

35:18.030 --> 35:19.030
The recipe is simple,

35:19.530 --> 35:21.220
but the extraction method varies.

35:22.220 --> 35:23.140
However, once you know

35:23.170 --> 35:24.130
the key,

35:24.360 --> 35:25.360
it's not difficult to brew.

35:26.030 --> 35:26.960
If you like it,

35:27.440 --> 35:28.440
I can teach you

35:28.440 --> 35:29.000
the extraction method.

35:29.760 --> 35:31.070
This way, when you return to Nanyang City,

35:31.480 --> 35:32.960
you can brew it yourself.

35:37.150 --> 35:37.590
Why?

35:38.630 --> 35:40.070
You think I'm here to persuade you?

35:50.230 --> 35:52.840
I've been drinking this wine for six years.

35:54.000 --> 35:55.480
What right do I have to persuade you?

36:02.070 --> 36:02.840
Do you know?

36:04.510 --> 36:05.800
When I was young,

36:06.760 --> 36:07.960
I offended an enemy.

36:09.000 --> 36:09.960
I couldn't catch him,

36:11.000 --> 36:11.880
and he escaped.

36:12.960 --> 36:13.670
Later,

36:14.960 --> 36:16.110
he hurt my family,

36:17.590 --> 36:18.960
infecting them with demon poison

36:19.550 --> 36:20.630
and making them lose their minds.

36:21.510 --> 36:22.280
In their heads,

36:22.760 --> 36:23.960
it was left with the desire to kill.

36:27.000 --> 36:27.960
I had no choice

36:29.110 --> 36:30.070
but to kill them all.

36:33.320 --> 36:35.510
My parents, my elder brother,

36:36.110 --> 36:37.230
and the servants in our house,

36:37.900 --> 36:39.300
all died by my hand.

36:50.920 --> 36:51.480
This wine

36:51.480 --> 36:52.760
is indeed a good thing.

36:54.440 --> 36:55.280
All these years,

36:56.030 --> 36:57.190
I've relied on this wine

36:57.190 --> 36:57.960
to get by.

36:59.310 --> 37:00.100
Whenever I feel that

37:00.130 --> 37:01.380
life is unbearable,

37:02.800 --> 37:04.230
whenever I miss my family,

37:05.000 --> 37:06.320
it could always deceive me,

37:07.400 --> 37:08.400
making me believe

37:09.510 --> 37:10.510
that nothing has changed.

37:12.300 --> 37:13.660
Every time before I go home,

37:14.440 --> 37:15.400
I always take a few sips

37:16.130 --> 37:17.130
at the doorstep.

37:18.710 --> 37:19.710
Then I push open the door,

37:22.960 --> 37:23.920
and everyone's there.

37:46.230 --> 37:47.760
You're a bit different from me.

37:49.300 --> 37:50.250
I've long been

37:50.280 --> 37:51.320
a lone wolf.

37:52.730 --> 37:53.770
Life and death are up to fate,

37:55.070 --> 37:56.030
no one cares.

37:58.030 --> 37:59.030
But you're different.

38:00.840 --> 38:01.840
You still have family,

38:03.710 --> 38:05.510
family waiting for you to return.

38:13.960 --> 38:15.030
In my home,

38:15.590 --> 38:16.510
there's no one left.

38:19.920 --> 38:20.960
Don't wait until

38:20.960 --> 38:22.070
your family is gone.

38:24.250 --> 38:25.540
By then, it will be too late

38:27.440 --> 38:28.510
to regret.

39:17.320 --> 39:18.000
Qiu.

39:27.320 --> 39:27.960
Manniang.

39:32.550 --> 39:33.480
I have to leave.

40:10.480 --> 40:13.030
I'm fine, you don't need to help me.

40:13.590 --> 40:15.000
I can walk on my own.

40:17.550 --> 40:19.000
What's wrong with you all?

40:19.280 --> 40:20.480
I can walk.

40:24.590 --> 40:25.280
Chi Xue.

40:27.400 --> 40:28.110
Where's Xuanye?

40:28.440 --> 40:28.960
I don't know.

40:29.550 --> 40:30.040
Xuanye told me to

40:30.060 --> 40:31.350
protect you without leaving your side for a single moment.

40:35.400 --> 40:36.150
Xuanye.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.440
What's wrong?

40:42.790 --> 40:45.320
I'm different from them.

40:45.890 --> 40:48.150
I know it's not real.

40:48.710 --> 40:49.580
What do you mean?

41:13.710 --> 41:14.480
Father.

41:17.060 --> 41:17.930
Slowly.

41:19.300 --> 41:21.180
Slowly, slowly, slowly.

41:21.400 --> 41:22.840
Drink some water, Father.

41:26.280 --> 41:26.800
Daughter.

41:28.000 --> 41:29.190
Father carved a little wooden doll.

41:29.810 --> 41:30.520
Do you like it?

41:30.550 --> 41:31.280
See if it looks like you.

41:33.320 --> 41:33.840
It does.

41:34.070 --> 41:34.510
It does, doesn't it?

41:34.540 --> 41:36.130
Wuniang likes it.

41:36.840 --> 41:39.290
Wuniang wants to give Father a massage on the back.

41:39.310 --> 41:39.830
Alright.

41:42.760 --> 41:44.800
Father, you've worked hard.

41:44.820 --> 41:45.730
Not hard at all.

41:47.930 --> 41:51.740
[Cuixiao Hall]

42:46.610 --> 42:47.690
I've warned you.

42:48.560 --> 42:49.760
Don't get close to him,

42:50.760 --> 42:51.440
nor

42:52.360 --> 42:53.760
appear in front of me.

42:57.510 --> 42:58.960
This is the last time.

43:00.310 --> 43:01.960
If you dare ruin my plans again,

43:02.960 --> 43:03.670
be wary

43:04.840 --> 43:06.480
that I'll take away

43:07.710 --> 43:08.710
the few lives you have left.
